{"2582960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NAKWON: LAST PARADISE", "steam_appid": 2582960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/b6a9fe5aa475f681a9d18881fd187515.poster.avif?t=1780295419\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/b6a9fe5aa475f681a9d18881fd187515.webm?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/b6a9fe5aa475f681a9d18881fd187515.mp4?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/a46e9e25e4fb98dbd756ce168260021c.poster.avif?t=1780295419\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/a46e9e25e4fb98dbd756ce168260021c.webm?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/a46e9e25e4fb98dbd756ce168260021c.mp4?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Zombie Survival Where Every Day is a Fight to Stay Alive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAKWON (or &quot;Paradise&quot;) is an immersive zombie survival game where your only goal is to stay alive. Begin your life as a refuge in a safe haven built by survivors. Head out to scavenge for food and supplies in a city overrun by the infected to manage your shelter. Every little thing counts in your fight for survival. Kitchen tools become weapons, small wounds can be fatal, and stress will eventually break your mind if left unmanaged. All these elements come together to deliver an authentic and immersive zombie apocalypse experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/6e5a3036923eba5883578e4e996f8aa9.poster.avif?t=1780295419\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/6e5a3036923eba5883578e4e996f8aa9.webm?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/6e5a3036923eba5883578e4e996f8aa9.mp4?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Risk Urban Expeditions Filled with Survivors and the Infected</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expedition areas are packed with the infected and other survivors who are desperate for resources. In this crumbling world, danger lurks around every corner and you'll never know what you're walking into. Survive the intense PvPvE expeditions in the ruins of a fallen city. Face the raw tension that grips your senses. Immerse yourself in the struggle to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/bdace86582cfada08911bdb6ccfeb321.poster.avif?t=1780295419\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/bdace86582cfada08911bdb6ccfeb321.webm?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/bdace86582cfada08911bdb6ccfeb321.mp4?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Survival Action Through Any Means Necessary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confrontation is not the only option—survival comes in many forms. Hide, run, betray, or cooperate. Do whatever it takes to make it out alive. Other survivors can't be trusted and the infected are deadly. In this world, your survival depends on the strategy you choose. <br>To survive in the face of unpredictable threats, you must stay alert to everything around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/c6a17a1e7b3bb2bb72d8e1df4592e2e5.poster.avif?t=1780295419\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/c6a17a1e7b3bb2bb72d8e1df4592e2e5.webm?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/c6a17a1e7b3bb2bb72d8e1df4592e2e5.mp4?t=1780295419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bringing Together Extraction Looting and Survival Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a NAKWON citizen, you must maintain your shelter during the day and scavenge the city at night for resources. Choose how to spend your days and nights - your survival depends on it. Set up your shelter with furniture, scrap resources to craft items, and upgrade your gear. <br>Plan your expeditions carefully and scour the city ruins for anything that can keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582960/extras/79b458c1250426a3e49e4e32b5273cd8.poster.avif?t=1780295419\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets